{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../../", "title": "Requests: HTTP for Humans\u2122"}, "next": {"link": "../quickstart/", "title": "Quickstart"}, "title": "Installation of Requests", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"installation-of-requests\">\n<span id=\"install\"></span><h1>Installation of Requests<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#installation-of-requests\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>This part of the documentation covers the installation of Requests.\nThe first step to using any software package is getting it properly installed.</p>\n<section id=\"python-m-pip-install-requests\">\n<h2>$ python -m pip install requests<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#python-m-pip-install-requests\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>To install Requests, simply run this simple command in your terminal of choice:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span>$ python -m pip install requests\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"get-the-source-code\">\n<h2>Get the Source Code<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#get-the-source-code\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>Requests is actively developed on GitHub, where the code is\n<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/psf/requests\">always available</a>.</p>\n<p>You can either clone the public repository:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span>$ git clone https://github.com/psf/requests.git\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<p>Or, download the <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/psf/requests/tarball/main\">tarball</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span>$ curl -OL https://github.com/psf/requests/tarball/main\n# optionally, zipball is also available (for Windows users).\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<p>Once you have a copy of the source, you can embed it in your own Python\npackage, or install it into your site-packages easily:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span>$ cd requests\n$ python -m pip install .\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["user/quickstart", "Quickstart", "N", "next"], ["index", "Requests: HTTP for Humans\u2122", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "user/install.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Installation of Requests</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#python-m-pip-install-requests\">$ python -m pip install requests</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#get-the-source-code\">Get the Source Code</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "user/install", "sidebars": ["sidebarlogo.html", "localtoc.html", "relations.html", "sourcelink.html", "searchbox.html", "hacks.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "show_sphinx": false}